<title>NETHERLANDS: BATENBURG BUYS BELGIAN COMPANY.</title>
<headline>BATENBURG BUYS BELGIAN COMPANY.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch technical wholesaler Batenburg Beheer NV said it had bought NV The Telephone Centre in the Belgian town of Grimbergen.</p>
<p>&quot;The takeover was financed from our own resources,&quot; the Dutch company said without giving further financial details.</p>
<p>The Telephone Centre is a trading company for telephone and telecommunications products, representing various international producers in the Belgian market. It has 18 employees.</p>
<p>Batenburg said the takeover is expected to positively affect its earnings in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
